OPTIMIZE (SYNTAX->OPTIMIZE TABLE_NAME)

“OPTIMIZE is used to resolve the small file problem in Delta tables. It compacts multiple small files into fewer large files, typically 100MB–1GB, improving scan efficiency and query performance. However, it is beneficial only when small files exist.”

VACCUM

VACUUM table_name;
VACUUM table_name RETAIN 168 HOURS;

“VACUUM is used to clean up old, unused files in Delta tables after operations like MERGE or OPTIMIZE, helping reduce storage and maintain performance while preserving recent history.”

